" * Create a no-args constructor if needed.\n"
" * Makes private no-args constructors package-private if necessary.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_ARC_TRANSFORM_UNPROXYABLE_CLASSES+++[]\n"
"--"
